{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif2.gif?t=1753287499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the blunt, sarcastic remarks of the narrator and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif_1.gif?t=1753287499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the Beach</strong> is a short, absurdist narrative experience where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">beautiful, traversable beach environment with full day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">short story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fully voiced narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">many objects that appear on the beach, which could potentially aid in your escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">multiple-choice questions with slightly branching narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Consider wishlisting the game if you find the concept interesting!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif3.gif?t=1753287499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1753287499","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740000?t=1753287499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/a9c149af1b3f617576871e093b1472d41d35b2e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753287499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/a9c149af1b3f617576871e093b1472d41d35b2e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753287499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself on a quiet tropical beach. Before you is the vast ocean, behind you\u2014a lush forest. Guiding you under the scorching sun is a soothing but ominous voice, whose intentions you're not quite sure of yet. Is it going to help you leave the beach, or force you to wander endlessly along a serene landscape of water and sand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif2.gif?t=1753287499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secrets of the beach and bask in its beauty, inquire about the out-of-place objects you find on it, listen to the blunt, sarcastic remarks of the narrator and try to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740000/extras/beach_trailer_gif